{
  "title": "Cache-Aside 两种写顺序：枚举所有交错统计脏数据占比",
  "code_lang": "python",
  "code_std": "python3",
  "stdin": "",
  "expected_output": "先删缓存后更新库: 共 10 种合法交错，其中 7 种导致 缓存!=库 (70%)\n先更新库后删缓存: 共 10 种合法交错，其中 5 种导致 缓存!=库 (50%)\n\n脏样本（先删缓存后更新库的典型交错）:\n  W:DEL R:GET_MISS R:READ_DB W:UPDATE R:SET_CACHE -> cache=OLD, db=NEW\n  W:DEL R:GET_MISS R:READ_DB R:SET_CACHE W:UPDATE -> cache=OLD, db=NEW\n  R:GET_MISS W:DEL R:READ_DB W:UPDATE R:SET_CACHE -> cache=OLD, db=NEW\n结论: 先删缓存后更新库的脏窗口明显更大，工程上应选择「先更新库再删缓存」\n",
  "code": "from itertools import combinations\n\ndef interleave(a, b):\n    \"\"\"枚举两个序列的所有交错（保持各自内部相对顺序）。\"\"\"\n    out = []\n    for ia in combinations(range(len(a) + len(b)), len(a)):\n        ib = [i for i in range(len(a) + len(b)) if i not in ia]\n        seq = [None] * (len(a) + len(b))\n        for pos, i in zip(ia, a):\n            seq[pos] = (\"W\", i)\n        for pos, i in zip(ib, b):\n            seq[pos] = (\"R\", i)\n        out.append(seq)\n    return out\n\n\ndef simulate(seq, writer_steps):\n    \"\"\"writer_steps: 写线程步骤列表；读线程固定 3 步。返回 (cache, db) 是否一致。\"\"\"\n    db = \"OLD\"\n    cache = {\"k\": \"OLD\"}\n    read_buf = None\n    for who, step in seq:\n        if who == \"W\":\n            if step == \"DEL\":\n                cache.pop(\"k\", None)\n            elif step == \"UPDATE\":\n                db = \"NEW\"\n        else:\n            if step == \"GET_MISS\":\n                read_buf = cache.get(\"k\")   # 可能为 None（miss）\n            elif step == \"READ_DB\":\n                read_buf = db\n            elif step == \"SET_CACHE\":\n                cache[\"k\"] = read_buf\n    return cache.get(\"k\"), db\n\n\nREADER = [\"GET_MISS\", \"READ_DB\", \"SET_CACHE\"]\n\nfor name, writer in [\n    (\"先删缓存后更新库\", [\"DEL\", \"UPDATE\"]),\n    (\"先更新库后删缓存\", [\"UPDATE\", \"DEL\"]),\n]:\n    seqs = interleave(writer, READER)\n    dirty = 0\n    for s in seqs:\n        c, d = simulate(s, writer)\n        if c != d:\n            dirty += 1\n    print(\"%s: 共 %d 种合法交错，其中 %d 种导致 缓存!=库 (%.0f%%)\"\n          % (name, len(seqs), dirty, 100.0 * dirty / len(seqs)))\n\nprint(\"\")\nprint(\"脏样本（先删缓存后更新库的典型交错）:\")\nseqs = interleave([\"DEL\", \"UPDATE\"], READER)\nshown = 0\nfor s in seqs:\n    c, d = simulate(s, [\"DEL\", \"UPDATE\"])\n    if c != d and shown < 3:\n        print(\"  %s -> cache=%s, db=%s\" % (\n            \" \".join(\"%s:%s\" % (w, st) for w, st in s), c, d))\n        shown += 1\nprint(\"结论: 先删缓存后更新库的脏窗口明显更大，工程上应选择「先更新库再删缓存」\")\n",
  "_verified": true
}